<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 4/5.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 4/5.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Thursday, June 5 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   05.06.97	  04.06.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5372	    6.5276</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3098	    2.3163</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5078	    4.5182</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4364	    3.4441</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5147	    0.5130</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7710	    0.7704</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2887	    0.2896</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9881	    6.9930</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6926	    0.6913</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2397	    1.2419</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
